# macOS PF (Packet Filter) Rule Template for Backend A (Laptop 3)
# Port: 3001
# Purpose: Service Isolation (Extension C)
# Only allow incoming TCP traffic from Edge Reverse Proxy (Mac 2) and localhost.
# Reject all direct connections from other network clients.

table <edge_server> { __EDGE_IP__ }

# Allow loopback (localhost) traffic
pass in quick proto tcp from 127.0.0.1 to any port 3001 flags S/SA keep state
pass in quick proto tcp from ::1 to any port 3001 flags S/SA keep state

# Allow incoming TCP from Edge Reverse Proxy (Mac 2)
pass in quick proto tcp from <edge_server> to any port 3001 flags S/SA keep state

# Block and reject all other incoming direct connections to port 3001
# 'return' sends an immediate TCP RST (Connection refused)
# Use 'drop' if you prefer silent packet drops (Connection timed out)
block return in quick proto tcp to any port 3001

